      <p>Configure Red Hat OpenShift Service Mesh features for your environment.</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/service_mesh/v2x/ossm-security#ossm-security">Security</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/service_mesh/v2x/ossm-traffic-manage#ossm-routing-traffic">Traffic management</a></li>
